    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Seamlessly connect your Gravity Forms submissions with your Mailcoach email marketing platform to automate your subscriber management. With this integration, you can automatically add form entries as subscribers to a specific Mailcoach email list. Whether you&#8217;re collecting newsletter signups, webinar registrations, or contact requests, this setup ensures your audience data flows directly into your Mailcoach campaigns—without manual exports.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>mailsync</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
